Build the threaded backend on OpenBSD for X11/XTest keyboard and mouse
input. Do not export a libevdev dependency: OpenBSD does not use uinput.

Index: third-party/libvirtualhid/CMakeLists.txt
--- third-party/libvirtualhid/CMakeLists.txt.orig
